docs {
Koreksi kontribusi oleh verifikator: isi entity DIGANTI dengan payload
koreksi. Body adalah discriminated union entity_type; snapshot pra-
koreksi tersimpan di audit old_data (action "correct").

Flag `publish` (opsional, default true):
- true  → is_corrected true + published + is_verified true (satu langkah);
          contributions.status = "corrected".
- false → KOREKSI SAJA: entity is_corrected true TAPI status tetap
          "pending_review"; contributions TETAP "pending" & tanpa review
          row (masih bisa di-approve/dikoreksi lagi). Lihat request
          "Correct Contribution (Tanpa Publish)".

Request ini mengoreksi contoh kalimat dari Add Example (perbaiki ejaan)
DAN langsung menerbitkannya.

200 sukses:

    {
      "success": true,
      "data": {
        "contribution_id": "01JDContribution0000000002",
        "entity_type": "example",
        "entity_id": "01JDExample00000000000000",
        "status": "corrected",
        "is_corrected": true
      }
    }

entity_type tidak cocok dengan kontribsi → 400 VALIDATION_ERROR.
Setelah correct, contoh tayang di GET /words/:id.
}

meta {
  name: Correct Contribution
  seq: 7
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/contributions/{{example_contribution_id}}/correct
  body: json
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{access_token}}
}

body:json {
  {
    "entity_type": "example",
    "publish": true,
    "comment": "Perbaiki ejaan",
    "source_sentence": "Iyo makatn dulu kah?",
    "target_sentence": "Sudah makan dulu, ya?",
    "source_type": "native_speaker"
  }
}

tests {
  test("200 + status corrected + is_corrected true", () => {
    expect(res.status).to.equal(200);
    expect(res.body.data.status).to.equal('corrected');
    expect(res.body.data.is_corrected).to.equal(true);
    expect(res.body.data.entity_type).to.equal('example');
  });
}
